<div class="form" style="max-width:1000px">
    <h2 style="font-size:24px">@EditorState.AppTitle</h2>
    <div class="accent" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:24px">@EditorState.Credit</div>
    <p style="font-size:15px">
        A free save editor for decrypted PS4 saves of NARUTO TO BORUTO: SHINOBI STRIKER.<br />
        It is free and always will be. If you paid for this editor or for an edited save, you were ripped off.
    </p>
    <h2>Credits</h2>
    <table style="width:auto">
        <tr><td class="accent"><b>@EditorState.Author</b></td><td>created the editor and mapped the save format</td><td></td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Blazor WebAssembly</b></td><td>runs the editor in your browser</td><td><a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/apps/aspnet/web-apps/blazor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dotnet.microsoft.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>.NET 8</b></td><td>what the editor runs on</td><td><a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dotnet.microsoft.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Unreal Engine 4</b></td><td>the save file (GVAS) and pak formats the game uses</td><td><a href="https://www.unrealengine.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">unrealengine.com</a></td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>NARUTO TO BORUTO: SHINOBI STRIKER</b></td><td>the game, by Soleil and Bandai Namco</td><td></td></tr>
    </table>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:24px">
        Item, jutsu and title names are the game's own text. This is a fan-made tool. It is not made, approved or supported by
        Bandai Namco, Soleil or anyone who owns NARUTO or BORUTO.
    </p>
    <p class="warning">Warning: this is an online game. Using an edited save is against the publisher's rules and can get your account banned. Use it at your own risk.</p>
</div>
